[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11160.87, "timestamp": "03:06:00", "text": "私はそれを辛い経験を通して学びましたが、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 11162.178, "timestamp": "03:06:02", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/dv90XtfhAurw8gTgzar4DAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/dv90XtfhAurw8gTgzar4DAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/dv90XtfhAurw8gTgzar4DA"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11163.99, "timestamp": "03:06:03", "text": "それは旅路です。 これは教訓ですよね？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11167.91, "timestamp": "03:06:07", "text": "私は多くのことを学びました。 えっと、これまで"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 11169.706, "timestamp": "03:06:09", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hmm hm"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11170.87, "timestamp": "03:06:10", "text": "私の配信を見てくださった方々には、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11175.19, "timestamp": "03:06:15", "text": "私の配信などを通じて何かを学んでいただけたら嬉しいです。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 11179.185, "timestamp": "03:06:19", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hahah"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11179.67, "timestamp": "03:06:19", "text": "えっと、私、人を楽しませたりするのが苦手なんです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11183.03, "timestamp": "03:06:23", "text": "。 えっと、私にも欠点や"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11186.79, "timestamp": "03:06:26", "text": "色々あるけど、それでも私の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11193.03, "timestamp": "03:06:33", "text": "欠点"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11196.79, "timestamp": "03:06:36", "text": "や色々にもかかわらず、私を応援して見てくれる人たちがいるんだよね？ あなたはわざわざ立ち寄って"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11201.349, "timestamp": "03:06:41", "text": "、挨拶して、私と話したりしたんですよね"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11204.95, "timestamp": "03:06:44", "text": "。 それは本当に大きな意味を持つ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11207.51, "timestamp": "03:06:47", "text": "私は今でも、自分の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11209.429, "timestamp": "03:06:49", "text": "始まり、Twitchでの最初の配信、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11213.429, "timestamp": "03:06:53", "text": "そしてそこに来てくれた人々のことを覚えています。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11215.67, "timestamp": "03:06:55", "text": "その名前を挙げたい気持ちはあるけど、うん、それは秘密にしておくよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11218.71, "timestamp": "03:06:58", "text": "。 そして、私が"}]